            1.0
          ],
          "hint": "LISTEN  This lesson does not prepare or reset a sound. Work with the settings you want to save. Do not change controls during a capture or recall.",
          "annotation": "LISTEN  This lesson does not prepare or reset a sound. Work with the settings you want to save. Do not change controls during a capture or recall.",
